@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Crear un Weapon
POST {{baseUrl}}/weapons/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mjolnir"
}

### 2. Consultar el Weapon creado por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/weapons/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Crear un Hero
POST {{baseUrl}}/heroes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Thor",
    "secret_name": "Thor Odinson",
    "age": 1000
}

### 4. Consultar el Hero creado por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/heroes/1
Accept: application/json

